m/MilkRoadStocks/status/2110188888258224620/video/1","media_key":"13_2110188855941058560","start":277,"url":"https://t.co/N6krqlbWgA"},{"display_url":"x.com/14909881851066…","end":324,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/1490988185106608130/status/2109637714236854586","start":301,"url":"https://t.co/0rkwGgxwJo"}]},"id":"2110188888258224620","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1924,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":3},"text":"Zuck broke down what it costs Meta to build frontier AI:\n\n\"To operate a gigawatt a year, call it on the order of $15 billion.\" Building that same one-gigawatt cluster costs $50 to $60 billion upfront.\n\nAnd all of that only covers the final training run.\n\nMeta is building well https://t.co/N6krqlbWgA https://t.co/0rkwGgxwJo","url":"https://x.com/MilkRoadStocks/status/2110188888258224620"},{"author_id":"2095765446717022208","created_at":"2026-10-14T10:33:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110318033415905721"],"id":"2110318033415905721","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":43,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Your idle Mac could be someone's GPU cluster.\nApple just published Minions: a dynamic, distributed virtual GPU cloud built on idle Apple Silicon devices (Oct 2026, Apple ML Research).\nHere is what it actually is:\nSpare silicon, pooled\nMinions turns idle Apple Silicon machines","url":"https://x.com/bybillx/status/2110318033415905721"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110121079461040128"]},"author_id":"2035729266705661952","created_at":"2026-10-13T21:30:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110121082451640647"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/S814PvhtdO","end":298,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/HeyDravon/status/2110121082451640647/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110121079461040128","start":275,"url":"https://t.co/S814PvhtdO"}]},"id":"2110121082451640647","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"apple quietly figured out you can turn a fleet of idle macbooks into a gpu cluster.\n\nthe paper says the gpus sit idle most of the day anyway, so they pooled them over the network for inference.\n\nthe datacenter is already on everyone's desk. we just keep buying more of them. https://t.co/S814PvhtdO","url":"https://x.com/HeyDravon/status/2110121082451640647"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2110692067060207616"]},"author_id":"2066133755480195072","created_at":"2026-10-15T14:14:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110736007222177971"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/9hDEq9gcHQ","end":303,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/SkadooshGG/status/2110736007222177971/video/1","media_key":"13_2110692067060207616","start":280,"url":"https://t.co/9hDEq9gcHQ"},{"display_url":"x.com/SkadooshGG/sta…","end":327,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/SkadooshGG/status/2109631550765850736","start":304,"url":"https://t.co/EYhjE5ttUE"}]},"id":"2110736007222177971","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":203,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":1},"text":"Meta CEO Mark Zuckerberg said building just one AI training cluster costs $50 to $60 billion.\n\n\"Obviously the amounts of money are like so obscenely large.\"\n\nAsked point blank what training a frontier AI model actually costs, he gave numbers labs usually keep vague.\n\n- about $15 https://t.co/9hDEq9gcHQ https://t.co/EYhjE5ttUE","url":"https://x.com/SkadooshGG/status/2110736007222177971"},{"author_id":"2070771579034996736","created_at":"2026-10-15T04:01:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110581904240001341"],"id":"2110581904240001341","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":19,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Quote: Microsoft (Scott Guthrie, Oct 12) — Azure Maia 300 (production 2027) designed as full system for long-context reasoning, latency-sensitive conversation, and multi-step agentic tasks. 96 accelerators per 167 kW rack, 288 GB HBM4 @ 18 TB/s each. Claims up to 7x rack-scale","url":"https://x.com/therealvane11/status/2110581904240001341"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2110381151399329792"]},"author_id":"1841919986014511104","created_at":"2026-10-14T14:45:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110381519374057744","2110391769888158006"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/2Yel9sBS1X","end":303,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/0xImpuls/status/2110381519374057744/video/1","media_key":"13_2110381151399329792","start":280,"url":"https://t.co/2Yel9sBS1X"}]},"id":"2110381519374057744","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"META’S AI TEAM REVEALED THE RISK: A $100-200 BILLION CHECK, SIGNED BEFORE ANYONE HAD SEEN THE MODEL\n\nPlanning for a frontier model starts in August. Whether it’s any good, you find out more than a year later.\n\nAt the end of last year, Meta’s exec team met in Hawaii. Research had https://t.co/2Yel9sBS1X","url":"https://x.com/0xImpuls/status/2110381519374057744"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2110671337454702592"]},"author_id":"1288595477060104192","created_at":"2026-10-15T10:04:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110673062140023006","2110673129114583512"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":119,"id":"2077914773703020545","start":108,"username":"epsilon_hq"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/33HNJCXqOK","end":299,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/verdacloud/status/2110673129114583512/video/1","media_key":"13_2110671337454702592","start":276,"url":"https://t.co/33HNJCXqOK"}]},"id":"2110673129114583512","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":360,"like_count":7,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":2},"text":"Downscale medical imaging to fit in GPU memory and the model loses the detail that catches faint findings.\n\n@epsilon_hq built its next-gen radiology AI models on a dedicated NVIDIA Blackwell Ultra cluster on Verda, now running 5x more experiments/week and training 3x faster. https://t.co/33HNJCXqOK","url":"https://x.com/verdacloud/status/2110673129114583512"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110134266126536704"]},"author_id":"2054371555845804032","created_at":"2026-10-13T22:23:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110134368845054194"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/M0fyw7IDuN","end":254,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/AiDoomScroll/status/2110134368845054194/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110134266126536704","start":231,"url":"https://t.co/M0fyw7IDuN"}]},"id":"2110134368845054194","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"nvidia just open-sourced everything. Nemotron 3.5 Bolt 74B has open weights, training data and recipes. PAIR splits workloads across your home PCs. Your house is now a mini datacenter. Send this to someone still renting GPU hours. https://t.co/M0fyw7IDuN","url":"https://x.com/AiDoomScroll/status/2110134368845054194"},{"author_id":"2931253795","created_at":"2026-10-15T04:12:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110584696589664574"],"id":"2110584696589664574","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":27,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"10-GPU cluster. Two training jobs, each needs 8 GPUs.\n\nKubernetes places pods one at a time, so each job gets 5 and waits for 3 more. They never come, because the other job holds them. All 10 GPUs sit idle.\n\nNVIDIA just open-sourced all of Run:ai. Its scheduler, KAI, stops this.","url":"https://x.com/sumitbopche01/status/2110584696589664574"},{"article":{"title":"Price War in the Chip Aisle"},"author_id":"10069172","created_at":"2026-10-14T18:59:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110445394845127086"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/i/article/2110…","end":172,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2110445181728374784","st